{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "School Identity Service",
    "description": "Authentication for the school assistant. The only service that decides who someone is, and the only one that can mint a token.\n\n**Tokens are RS256.** Other services verify against `/.well-known/jwks.json` with a public key and hold nothing that could forge one. That is what keeps identity resolution out of the chat backend and the records facade.\n\n**The `guardian_id` claim is the whole integration.** It is set only by an administrator through `PUT /v1/admin/accounts/{username}/guardian-binding`, never at self-registration and never from a request body on a public route. A token without the claim can read no student records at all.\n\n**Parents sign in through WhatsApp, not with a password.** They ask for a challenge, send a pre-filled message from their own WhatsApp, and type back a code. WhatsApp proves they control the number; the school's own records decide whether that number belongs to a parent. Neither the browser nor the parent ever states which guardian they are.",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/.well-known/jwks.json": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "keys"
        ],
        "summary": "Jwks",
        "description": "The public signing key.\n\nEvery other service verifies tokens against this and holds nothing that could\nmint one. Public by design — a public key is not a secret.",
        "operationId": "jwks__well_known_jwks_json_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Jwks  Well Known Jwks Json Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Login",
        "description": "Exchange credentials for tokens.\n\nAn unknown username and a wrong password produce the same 401 with the same\nmessage. Distinguishing them turns this endpoint into an account enumerator, and\nfor a school that means confirming which parents are registered.",
        "operationId": "login_v1_auth_login_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoginIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "423": {
            "description": "Account temporarily locked.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/register": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Register",
        "description": "Self-registration, ported from the old chat backend.\n\nProduces an account that can sign in and read no student records whatsoever: the\nguardian binding is a separate, admin-only write, and nothing on this path can\nreach it. That is what makes leaving self-registration open acceptable — the worst\na stranger gets is a chat account.",
        "operationId": "register_v1_auth_register_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegisterIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/refresh": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Refresh",
        "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a fresh access token.\n\nThe guardian binding is re-read from the account here, not carried over from the\nold token. That is what makes a revoked or corrected binding take effect within\none access-token lifetime instead of persisting until the parent happens to log\nout — the case that matters is a custody change, and it must not wait a month.",
        "operationId": "refresh_v1_auth_refresh_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefreshIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccessTokenOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "423": {
            "description": "Account temporarily locked.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/logout": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Logout",
        "description": "Revoke a refresh token.\n\nThe access token already issued stays valid until it expires — offline\nverification is the trade made for not calling this service on every request.\nKeeping access tokens short is what bounds that window.",
        "operationId": "logout_v1_auth_logout_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefreshIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Logout V1 Auth Logout Post"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/me": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Me",
        "description": "Decode the caller's own token. Useful to a front end; used by nothing critical.",
        "operationId": "me_v1_auth_me_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "authorization",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Authorization"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MeOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "423": {
            "description": "Account temporarily locked.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/whatsapp/start": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Start Whatsapp Verification",
        "description": "Begin a verification. Takes no phone number, and that is the point.\n\nBecause the caller states nothing, there is nothing here to probe: this endpoint cannot\nbe used to ask whether a given number belongs to a parent. That question is answered\nonly to somebody who can actually send a WhatsApp message from the number, and it is\nanswered over WhatsApp rather than in this response.",
        "operationId": "start_whatsapp_verification_v1_auth_whatsapp_start_post",
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WhatsAppStartOut"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/whatsapp/status": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Whatsapp Verification Status",
        "description": "Where has this verification got to? Polled while the parent goes to tap send.",
        "operationId": "whatsapp_verification_status_v1_auth_whatsapp_status_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WhatsAppStatusIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WhatsAppStatusOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/auth/whatsapp/verify": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Complete Whatsapp Verification",
        "description": "The code, and the tokens if it is right.\n\nThe account is created here on first use rather than by an administrator, and the\nbinding written onto it does not come from this request: it came from the school's own\nrecords, keyed on a number WhatsApp proved. That is the invariant identity/models.py\nstates — an account never names its own guardian — held through a second authority\nrather than broken by one.",
        "operationId": "complete_whatsapp_verification_v1_auth_whatsapp_verify_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WhatsAppVerifyIn"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "423": {
            "description": "Account temporarily locked.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorOut"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/admin/accounts": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "admin"
        ],
        "summary": "Create Account",
        "description": "Create a login. Note what this route cannot do: bind a guardian.\n\nCreation and binding are deliberately two calls. A bulk parent import that runs\nonly this one produces accounts that can log in and read nothing, which is the\nsafe half-finished state.",
        "operationId": "create_account_v1_admin_accounts_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Admin-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Admin-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccountIn"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Create Account V1 Admin Accounts Post"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/admin/accounts/{username}/guardian-binding": {
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "admin"
        ],
        "summary": "Bind Guardian",
        "description": "Bind a login to a guardian. The single most sensitive write in the system.\n\nAudited as its own event type, because \"who decided this parent is that guardian\"\nis the first question anyone asks after a records leak.",
        "operationId": "bind_guardian_v1_admin_accounts__username__guardian_binding_put",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "username",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Username"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Admin-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Admin-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GuardianBindingIn"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Bind Guardian V1 Admin Accounts  Username  Guardian Binding Put"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "admin"
        ],
        "summary": "Unbind Guardian",
        "description": "Remove a binding — the custody-change path.\n\nTakes effect for new access tokens immediately and for existing ones within their\nremaining lifetime. Revoke the refresh token too when the change is urgent.",
        "operationId": "unbind_guardian_v1_admin_accounts__username__guardian_binding_delete",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "username",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Username"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "X-Admin-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "X-Admin-Key"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "title": "Response Unbind Guardian V1 Admin Accounts  Username  Guardian Binding Delete"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "ops"
        ],
        "summary": "Health",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Health Health Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AccessTokenOut": {
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Access Token"
          },
          "token_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Token Type",
            "default": "Bearer"
          },
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Expires At"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "expires_at"
        ],
        "title": "AccessTokenOut"
      },
      "AccountIn": {
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Username"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Password"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Role",
            "description": "user | admin | parent | staff",
            "default": "parent"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Phone",
            "default": ""
          },
          "display_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Display Name",
            "default": ""
          },
          "preferred_language": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Preferred Language",
            "default": "ar"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "username",
          "password"
        ],
        "title": "AccountIn"
      },
      "ErrorOut": {
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Code",
            "description": "not_authorized | locked | not_found | conflict | not_configured"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message",
            "default": ""
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code"
        ],
        "title": "ErrorOut"
      },
      "GuardianBindingIn": {
        "properties": {
          "guardian_external_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Guardian External Id"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "guardian_external_id"
        ],
        "title": "GuardianBindingIn",
        "description": "Binds a login to a guardian in the records facade.\n\nThe most sensitive write in the system. There is no self-service path to it: an\naccount that could name its own guardian id could read any family's records."
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "LoginIn": {
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Username"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Password"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "username",
          "password"
        ],
        "title": "LoginIn"
      },
      "MeOut": {
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Username"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Role"
          },
          "guardian_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Guardian Id"
          },
          "display_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Display Name",
            "default": ""
          },
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Expires At"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "username",
          "role",
          "expires_at"
        ],
        "title": "MeOut"
      },
      "RefreshIn": {
        "properties": {
          "refresh_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Refresh Token"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "refresh_token"
        ],
        "title": "RefreshIn"
      },
      "RegisterIn": {
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Username"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Password"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Role",
            "description": "user | admin",
            "default": "user"
          },
          "admin_code": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Admin Code"
          },
          "display_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Display Name",
            "default": ""
          },
          "preferred_language": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Preferred Language",
            "default": "ar"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "username",
          "password"
        ],
        "title": "RegisterIn",
        "description": "Self-registration, ported from the old chat backend's `/auth/register`.\n\n`role` may only be \"user\" or \"admin\", and \"admin\" requires `admin_code`. There is\ndeliberately no way to self-register as a parent: that role is paired with a\nguardian binding, and both are an administrator's decision."
      },
      "TokenOut": {
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Access Token"
          },
          "refresh_token": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Refresh Token"
          },
          "token_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Token Type",
            "default": "Bearer"
          },
          "expires_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Expires At"
          },
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Username"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Role"
          },
          "guardian_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Guardian Id"
          },
          "display_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Display Name",
            "default": ""
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "access_token",
          "refresh_token",
          "expires_at",
          "username",
          "role"
        ],
        "title": "TokenOut",
        "description": "What a successful login returns.\n\n`guardian_id` is echoed so a front end can tell a parent session from a staff one\nwithout decoding the token. It is a convenience for rendering, never a source of\ntruth — the value other services trust is the signed claim, not this field."
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
